## Interpretation

The 10x-20x exchange leverage value is only a margin ceiling. Account risk is
set from the ATR stop, and the simulator blocks martingale/averaging down. A
high displayed leverage therefore does not automatically create high account
returns. The strategy must earn its return from multi-symbol selection and
range-edge mean reversion after costs.
"""
    (OUT / "report.md").write_text(report)
    print(report)


if __name__ == "__main__":
    main()
